        "id": 0,
        "original_id": "3d526475-c1a8-5746-9e09-249f9b88ec3e",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Companies: VIVA Media GmbH\n- Products: Viva (UK and Ireland)\n- Concepts: Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung (GmbH), German company law\n- Places: Germany, United Kingdom, Ireland, Austria, Switzerland, Liechtenstein\n\nFacts:\n- VIVA Media GmbH was called VIVA Media AG until 2004.\n- VIVA Media GmbH is a music television network originating from Germany.\n- In German company law, a private company with limited liability is known as a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung, abbreviated GmbH.\n- A Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is a very common type of legal entity in Germany, Austria, Switzerland, and Liechtenstein.\n- In Switzerland, a Gesellschaft mit beschränkter Haftung is equivalent to an S.à r.l.\n- Viva, stylised as VIVA, is a music television channel in the United Kingdom and Ireland.\n- Viva is owned by VIVA Media and thereby by Viacom International Media Networks Europe.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
